{
  "description": "Retrieval-only paraphrase set: the same needs as benchmark questions but phrased the way users talk, avoiding the catalog's own names and synonyms (plus one English question). Keyword-only BuildPrompt finds the needed tables for 7/20 (mean recall 0.375) versus 36/36 on questions.json, so this set measures what semantic (embedding) retrieval adds. Run: node scripts/benchmark-retrieval.js --questions benchmark/02/paraphrase_questions.json [--embed-url http://embeddings:80/embed]",
